{
 "**Control Center** (iOS 18 and later): open it, tap **+**, then **Add a Control** and search for OutBrick. There are buttons for Continue level, Open Journey, Open Shop and Random level, switches for **Music** and **Colour-blind glyphs**, and status controls for your streak, lives and a friend.": "help:apple-features",
 "**Game Center** is Apple’s, under your Game Center settings.": "help:progress-privacy-and-account",
 "**Handoff:** start a board on one device and continue it on another signed in to the same Apple Account.": "help:apple-features",
 "**Language:** OutBrick follows your iPhone’s language. To choose another just for OutBrick, open the iPhone **Settings › Apps › OutBrick › Language**.": "help:settings",
 "**Live Activities and notification styles:** in the iPhone **Settings › Apps › OutBrick**.": "help:settings",
 "**Live Activity:** while you play a board, its progress shows on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island. Leave the game and it says your board is waiting; clear it and it shows your result. Tap it to go back. Turn Live Activities off in the iPhone **Settings › Apps › OutBrick**.": "help:apple-features",
 "**Lock Screen:** an OutBrick widget, Streak Ring, Coins, Daily Brick, Next Level, Event Countdown and Brick Pass, plus small inline lines for your streak, level or Daily Brick.": "help:apple-features",
 "**Quick actions:** touch and hold the OutBrick icon for **Play next level**, **Journey** and **Shop**.": "help:apple-features",
 "**Restore purchases:** at the bottom of the **Shop**.": "help:settings",
 "**Spotlight:** swipe down on the Home Screen and search for a level you have reached, a village, a chapter, a friend, an event, or screens like “Accessibility settings” and “Brick Pass”.": "help:apple-features",
 "**The Leaders tab** shows your player name, level and, if you choose, a flag. Turn off **Settings › Game › Show me on the standings board** to be removed; hide your flag in your Profile.": "help:progress-privacy-and-account",
 "**The game’s version number:** at the foot of your **Profile**.": "help:settings",
 "**Village Race and Brick Royale** share your player name with the players in that race, only if you join.": "help:progress-privacy-and-account",
 "**Visual Intelligence** (iOS 26 and later): point the camera at, or take a screenshot of, OutBrick art to find the matching village, friend or level. It runs entirely on your device.": "help:apple-features",
 "**Your name, avatar and flag:** in your **Profile** (tap your avatar).": "help:settings",
 "A friend: one you choose, or “Surprise me”.": "help:apple-features",
 "A random board, played right in the widget on iOS 17 and later.": "help:apple-features",
 "Advertising and tracking choices": "help:progress-privacy-and-account",
 "After a win, goes straight to the next board instead of back to the Journey map.": "help:settings",
 "Animation speed, Announcement detail, Colour-blind, High-contrast board, Left-handed tray, Hold to confirm swaps and Row sound are each explained in [Accessibility in OutBrick](help:accessibility#where).": "help:settings",
 "At most **one notification every 20 hours**, and never between 22:00 and 09:00. Each one offers **Play**, **Later** (three hours) or **Tomorrow**.": "help:apple-features",
